The amateur data is fetched too, but ignored here. A move that appears only in the amateur list never gets an entry, so it can't become a candidate. Amateur data is used when choosing White's moves, not when scoring Black's. ^xlkBtSdm

The code also copies White's win counts into each entry, but nothing anywhere ever reads them. ^E2jgUDHN

